{"id": "c103", "category": "very_long", "language": "en-US", "text": "Hi, so I'm writing because I've had a really frustrating week and I honestly don't know who else to ask. It started when I ordered a gift for my sister's birthday from your shop, and the tracking page said it would arrive on Tuesday, but then it changed to Thursday, and then it just stopped updating altogether. I called the courier and they told me to contact you, and when I emailed your support address I got an automatic reply saying someone would get back to me within forty-eight hours, which never happened. Meanwhile the birthday came and went, and now I'm not even sure whether I should ask for a refund, a replacement, or just some kind of explanation for what went wrong with the delivery and why nobody answered my messages.", "expected": "handoff", "split": "tune", "source": "authored", "review_status": "source text"}
